      "writtenOn": "2022-09-30T15:04:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right. I\u0027m okay with it, as long as we commit to finding a way to recover this. I agree that just having a proper writer for skcms_ICCProfile in skcms makes more sense, anyway.\n\nI am going to want to see what the code-size delta is for this change (Skia is currently fighting hard to reduce size, so we\u0027re actively monitoring it).",
      "parentUuid": "e23e2b35_dde7ecb4",
      "revId": "25af8b8f47411a2b7d2d80dc8ee39dbb54834ed6",
